                                        "entry_id": "7ff6232a-a5c0-3d51-b8e6-3f7bb09e8296",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of several species of small, mostly European rodents of the family Gliridae.",
                                            "Muscardinus avellanarius (hazel dormouse)."
